      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Yuki: We're having an issue with the report, but I can't make the problem happen on my computer. Could you clarify the last step?<br>Lee: I click Save, and the page goes blank.<br>Yuki: Can you show me the error? Which browser did you use?<br>Lee: Chrome, on my laptop.<br>Yuki: Does it happen when you use another browser?<br>Lee: I haven't tried that yet.<br>Yuki: Could you help me check that now? We need to check whether it affects one browser or every browser. After that, I'll share the results with our developers so they have clear details.</div>"
    },
