      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Ask for a more precise explanation. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Could you clarify what happens after you click Save?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Ask someone to demonstrate or show something. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Can you show me how to open the report?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Ask which specific tool or option was used. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Which account did you use to test the page?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Check the condition in which a problem occurs. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Does it happen when you use another browser?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Invite someone to check something with you. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Could you help me check whether the issue affects mobile users?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Say which action you have not tried yet. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I haven't tried changing the database yet.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"
