    {
      "id": "speaking",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">Could you clarify the last step? /<br>Can you show me the error? /<br>Which browser did you use?</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Ask a colleague for the information you need.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What problem are you seeing?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>Who is affected?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What have you checked so far?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What do you suggest we do next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"
    },
